      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，我受邀来到空中救世主家，再次郑重\n问候。我险些把名片夹掉在地上，却还是拼命\n低头行礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4be15ff4b028c33d39af34daeffdb92eeda5b723efd08e932d6e98a7cbc89f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
