      "uid": "zhcn:275f8018066aa21e105db27d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――原来如此。您对女儿的态度，她付出的努力，\n都怀有深深的敬意啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ceba2fb1441ccac291ec794c5deb401aeb4042600b282dee3964dea07ec58e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
