      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e68358aea007010f1291ed5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这点我也一样吧。身为母亲，\n每当看到这孩子总是认真踏实地努力\n我也不禁对她心生敬佩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e2d534ce85eb3cb31d157e54bfe14cf6c1be00c46c4c3e0079e6025e624609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a494a9c8c4db8bf92b6c52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
