      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70490b55e846f6c0b6adc9fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到这里，空中救世主的母亲忽然望向\n挂在墙上的软木板。\n我也顺着她的视线，望了过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99c2cbc87a6f1224083d089fdf5b7cc7869fca8676c84bc396cd19ec4fec725c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363b005807b0c7bc374aa126",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "软木板上除了几张全家福，\n还贴着……一张画纸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "579a9fba9abede97ecd111274dc8363a54054b4187d657f1749c0ad2ad247b47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:472f040168f26e19ea2331dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "画纸上，是年幼的孩子竭力画出的\n一幅赛马娘画像。还有『热胜报』这个标题――",
      "source_fingerprint": "df12beb4942cfc87d9a7ef9169cf0d6fb8a1dbf1765aa045fac23f4f2924431a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e534e4938916c2d47e2d6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『非常，非常厉害！』\n『努力，跑得快，又帅气！』\n『漂亮，出色，最喜欢了！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6a5952d5bcc490e69b5316f7c3337b88fb749b36c5f6580ac83ebb6cb6c9224",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e27d6354bf0756885fa845",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再写上『今后也请多多指教』，然后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f7f8cf4bfb070759b1f0fbc3337aa4d598853e8f5672fa296352c5f2e482208",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111100.json",
      "json_path": [
